        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.5599365234375,
        181.06338500976562,
        98.2879409790039
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccination",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        102.13409423828125,
        513.3684692382812,
        115.485595703125
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccination should not be given to infants or children with known HIV infection",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        118.06161499023438,
        513.4605102539062,
        131.48211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(3) because of the risk of disseminated BCG disease  . This is discussed in more detail in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        134.12713623046875,
        137.4449005126953,
        147.4786376953125
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 5.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        160.29852294921875,
        288.4153747558594,
        177.02651977539062
      ],
      "text": "Contact screening and case-finding",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        180.87274169921875,
        513.4718017578125,
        194.2242431640625
      ],
      "text": "The approach to screening and management of children who are contacts of a TB case",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        196.8692626953125,
        513.4259643554688,
        210.22076416015625
      ],
      "text": "and living with HIV is outlined in Chapter 5. A child living with HIV who is exposed to an",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        212.79678344726562,
        458.22601318359375,
        226.21728515625
      ],
      "text": "(1, 4) infectious case of TB is at particular high risk of developing TB disease .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        237.30325317382812,
        513.3916015625,
        250.7237548828125
      ],
      "text": "(4)  Current WHO recommendations  are that all household contacts of an infectious",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02789306640625,
        253.3687744140625,
        513.4374389648438,
        266.72027587890625
      ],
      "text": "case of TB should be screened for symptoms of TB and that, if TB is excluded, preventive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02789306640625,
        269.36529541015625,
        228.39837646484375,
        282.716796875
      ],
      "text": "therapy should be offered to:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        291.6805419921875,
        366.94580078125,
        305.14703369140625
      ],
      "text": "HIV-negative children aged less than 5 years; and,  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        311.74981689453125,
        280.2242736816406,
        325.21630859375
      ],
      "text": "HIV-positive contacts of any age. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        333.4158020019531,
        513.47900390625,
        346.7673034667969
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for preventing TB in children living with HIV have not changed since",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        349.3432922363281,
        513.3983154296875,
        362.7637939453125
      ],
      "text": "(5)  (6) the 2006 edition of the guidance   and remain consistent with recent guidelines .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        365.4087829589844,
        513.4559326171875,
        378.7602844238281
      ],
      "text": "Symptom-based screening is recommended because children living with HIV who do",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        381.4052734375,
        513.3867797851562,
        394.75677490234375
      ],
      "text": "not have suggestive symptoms such as poor weight gain, fever or current cough are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        397.332763671875,
        513.3867797851562,
        410.7532653808594
      ],
      "text": "(1, 6-8) unlikely to have TB disease  . Children living with HIV who are close contacts of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        413.39825439453125,
        513.409912109375,
        426.749755859375
      ],
      "text": "an active TB case and with no evidence of TB disease should begin IPT regardless of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        429.3947448730469,
        513.4443359375,
        442.7462463378906
      ],
      "text": "age. The recommended dose of isoniazid for preventive therapy is 10 mg/kg (range",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        445.3912353515625,
        513.432861328125,
        458.74273681640625
      ],
      "text": "7-15 mg/kg, maximum 300 mg/day) daily for at least 6 months. Providing IPT to people",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        461.3877258300781,
        513.4100341796875,
        474.7392272949219
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV does not increase the risk of developing isoniazid-resistant TB: concerns",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        477.38421630859375,
        513.47900390625,
        490.7357177734375
      ],
      "text": "regarding the development of isoniazid resistance should not be a barrier to providing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        493.31170654296875,
        143.84580993652344,
        506.7322082519531
      ],
      "text": "(2, 8, 9) IPT  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        513.914306640625,
        200.41928100585938,
        530.642333984375
      ],
      "text": "Primary prophylaxis",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        534.4884033203125,
        513.471923828125,
        547.8399047851562
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations have also been made for IPT for infants and children living with HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        550.4849243164062,
        513.3568725585938,
        563.83642578125
      ],
      "text": "who are considered unlikely to have TB and with no known exposure to TB; this is also",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        566.4124145507812,
        300.8482971191406,
        579.8328857421875
      ],
      "text": "(6, 7, 10, 11) known as primary prophylaxis  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        593.5064086914062,
        213.5863037109375,
        607.1339111328125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 25 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03929901123047,
        614.1055297851562,
        510.21539306640625,
        629.4395141601562
      ],
      "text": "Children living with HIV who are more than 12 months of age and who are un-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03929901123047,
        627.3055419921875,
        513.2843627929688,
        642.6395263671875
      ],
      "text": "likely to have TB disease on symptom-based screening and have no contact",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03929901123047,
        640.5054931640625,
        183.11927795410156,
        655.8394775390625
      ],
      "text": "with a TB case:",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88929748535156,
        660.7510375976562,
        510.2192687988281,
        674.9420166015625
      ],
      "text": "should be offered 6 months of IPT (10 mg/kg per day, range 7–15 mg/ ·",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73729705810547,
        674.551025390625,
        513.4738159179688,
        688.1785278320312
      ],
      "text": "kg, maximum dose 300 mg/day) as part of a comprehensive package",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73729705810547,
        688.3510131835938,
        513.3702392578125,
        701.978515625
      ],
      "text": "of HIV prevention and care services if living in settings with a high TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73729705810547,
        702.7490234375,
        179.3297882080078,
        716.3765258789062
      ],
      "text": "prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73729705810547,
        722.8280029296875,
        365.6872863769531,
        736.1795043945312
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "57",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}